# Honoteca — environment. Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill in.

# Detrás de un reverse proxy (Caddy/nginx) pon 1 para ver la IP real del cliente (rate limit
# del login) y el protocolo. Directo a internet, déjalo sin definir.
# TRUST_PROXY=1

# En producción (NODE_ENV=production) el server NO arranca sin OWNER_EMAIL.
# NODE_ENV=production

# --- metadatos (opcional) -----------------------------------------------------------
# Google Books API key — OPTIONAL, and off by default.
# With no value the source is left out of the lookup chain entirely: openbd + NDL +
# Open Library already cover Japanese books well, and a source you never asked is not
# a source that said no (so the scan screen stays quiet about it).
# Set it only if you want the 4th source. If a key IS set and still gets refused, the
# scan screen names the reason (quota reached / key not valid / API not enabled).
# Get one free (no card): https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/books.googleapis.com
GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY=

# --- opcionales ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# PORT=8849
# HOST=0.0.0.0
